{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日放送の乃木中\n収録に参加しましたー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週も出てましたが\n今週も出てます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/06/1026229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表とか歌収録とかをぬいたら\nトーク収録に参加したのは\nたぶん3か月半ぶりだったんだよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の冠番組だけど\nちょっと緊張した( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/06/1026229/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/06/1026229/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月27日の\n「らじらー！サンデー『今夜はパーリナイ！』」公開生放送\n出るみたいです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今この公式サイトを見て知りました！！わお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週出させてもらったばっかりなのに\nらじらー！にまた出れるなんて楽しみです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/06/1026229/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観覧申込はこちら"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/06/1026229/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://pid.nhk.or.jp/event/PPG0272442/index.html"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年内最後の握手会の後にあるので\n名古屋個別にかけつけてくれる方は\n是非来てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/06/1026229/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠征組は帰れなくなりそうだけど\nまあこの際、名古屋に泊まっちゃおう！(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週のらじらー！\nみなさん聴いてくださいましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶん中田は人生で\n「おなら」ってワード自体ほとんど言ったことないです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言えないから\n言わないように避けてきたんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これくらいのレベルでも\n下品な言葉を言おうとすると\nどもってしまう中田は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「おなら鼓動」というキャラを確立しました(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、ブログに書いてても\n違和感極まりない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも\n新境地を開拓できたような気がして清々しいです` ･ω･ ´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らじらー！サンデー 楽しみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/06/1026229/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}